        functionAndGlobalVariableDeclaration:
            ```javascript-browser
            function confirma(pid) 
            {
            javascript:window.open('f?p=&APP_ID.:214:&SESSION.::NO:214:P214_IDVENCIMENTO:'+pid,'popup','toolbar=yes,location=no,status=no,menubar=no,scrollbars=no,resizable=no,width=300,height=200,screenX=50,screenY =100');void(0);
